    <para>Angie has $20 to spend on juice boxes for her son’s preschool picnic. Each pack of juice boxes costs $2.63. Write an inequality to represent the maximum number of packs, \( p \), she can buy.</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    
